timestamp=2026-09-03T08:10:52.772Z level=INFO run=9ba47d74 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat << 'SCRIPT' > /tmp/fix_docs_v2.py\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\ndef fix_doc_file(filepath):\n    with open(filepath, 'r') as f:\n        lines = f.readlines()\n    \n    new_lines = []\n    for line in lines:\n        # Only replace markdown code fences at the start of line (no leading whitespace)\n        if line.startswith('```python'):\n            new_lines.append('<code>\\n')\n        elif line.startswith('```py'):\n            new_lines.append('<code>\\n')\n        elif line.startswith('```text'):\n            new_lines.append('<code>\\n')\n        elif line.startswith('```'):\n            new_lines.append('</code>\\n')\n        else:\n            new_lines.append(line)\n    \n    with open(filepath, 'w') as f:\n        f.writelines(new_lines)\n    \n    print(f\"Fixed {filepath}\")\n\nfix_doc_file('/testbed/docs/source/en/tutorials/building_good_agents.mdx')\nSCRIPT" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
