{"type":"text","timestamp":1788423134963,"sessionID":"ses_f99afb648fferdF0RjDSnV5iem","part":{"id":"prt_066535d81001Vc60wUT3up4rwL","messageID":"msg_066535961001lAsxRQuqbROnvR","sessionID":"ses_f99afb648fferdF0RjDSnV5iem","type":"text","text":"\n\nThe XML code block transition has been implemented. Here's what was changed:\n\n## Core Changes\n\n### 1. Code Parsing (`src/smolagents/utils.py`)\n- Updated `extract_code_from_text()` to prioritize XML `<code>...</code>` tags\n- Falls back to markdown fences ` ``` ` for compatibility\n- Updated error messages to reference XML format\n\n### 2. Prompt Templates\n**`src/smolagents/prompts/code_agent.yaml`**\n- All code examples now use `<code>...</code>` instead of markdown fences\n- Added `{{custom_instructions}}` placeholder in system prompt\n- Changed rule description to reference XML format\n\n**`src/smolagents/prompts/structured_code_agent.yaml`**\n- Same XML code block conversion\n- Added `{{custom_instructions}}` placeholder\n\n**`src/smolagents/prompts/toolcalling_agent.yaml`**\n- Added `{{custom_instructions}}` placeholder\n\n### 3. Agent Support (`src/smolagents/agents.py`)\n- Added `custom_instructions: str | None = None` parameter to `CodeAgent.__init__()`\n- Updated `initialize_system_prompt()` to inject custom instructions\n\n### 4. Vision Web Browser (`src/smolagents/vision_web_browser.py`)\n- Updated `helium_instructions` to use XML code blocks\n\n### 5. Documentation\nThe building_good_agents.mdx and other documentation files have markdown code blocks that should be converted to XML format. This requires careful, file-by-file conversion to maintain proper structure.\n\n## Testing\nBoth XML and markdown code block parsing work correctly, ensuring backward compatibility during the transition.","time":{"start":1788423134593,"end":1788423134959}}}
